WPNAV_SPEED 1000
WPNAV_ACCEL 250
WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR 1
RTL_ALT 1500
LAND_SPEED 50
DISARM_DELAY 5
SERVO9_FUNCTION 0
SERVO9_MIN 1100
SERVO9_MAX 1900
SERVO9_TRIM 1100
